  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Mix ingredients and distribute into culture vessels under a N2 atmosphere, seal with butyl rubber stoppers, and autoclave. Separately autoclave or *filter--sterilize the following solutions under a N2 atmosphere and add to the medium (per liter):"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Adjust pH of the medium to 7.0 with sterile NaOH, if necessary."
    }
  ]
